            </t>
            <t vertical="0" index="60" torder="1" hasRuby="0" id="" time="">
                <start-time>00:04:16,000</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:19,975</end-time>
                <translation>这就是这个世界的形态</translation>
                <original>それがこの世界の姿である</original>
