            </t>
            <t vertical="0" index="105" torder="1" hasRuby="0" id="" time="">
                <start-time>00:06:36,625</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:39,932</end-time>
                <translation>即“不同的事物在保持不同的状态下合而为一”</translation>
                <original>異なるものが異なるままで一つになる</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t vertical="0" index="106" torder="1" hasRuby="0" id="" time="">
                <start-time>00:06:39,932</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:42,275</end-time>
                <translation>若松老师 这具体是什么意思呢？</translation>
                <original>こととありますがこれは若松さんどういうことでしょうか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t vertical="0" index="107" torder="1" hasRuby="0" id="" time="">
                <start-time>00:06:42,275</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:44,737</end-time>
                <translation>是啊 确实可以理解为“合而为一”</translation>
