            <t vertical="0" index="201" torder="1" hasRuby="0" id="" time="">
                <start-time>00:11:39,450</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:44,750</end-time>
                <translation>西田认为 一个超越了过去、现在、未来矛盾关系的世界便会显现
