            <t vertical="0" index="356" torder="1" hasRuby="0" id="" time="">
                <start-time>00:20:58,725</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:01,360</end-time>
                <translation>这个更宏大的“我”得以绽放 </translation>
                <original>大きな私が開花していくのが</original>
